:====
# A rule can't be a method.

-- Words().first("ab")

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ Words

────────────────────
+ first String
    - text String

match text
    ~ \word
    ?? "none"

────────────────────
+ word ~ Char String

~ [a-z]+

