:====
# A local rule takes no arguments.

-- match "aaaaa"
    ~ \run(5)
    ?? "none"
    .. run ~
        ~ "a"+

:----
%compile-error

Exception: A local rule takes no arguments or types; declare it at module level to give it some
<no file:3>
